      "statement": "The gadget worker is a Dynamic Worker definition built from the gadget's .js modules with mainModule server.js, globalOutbound null (no internet at all), a GadgetTailLoopback tail, and a LOADER cache key embedding the overseer-wide codeVersion plus chat id/sequence so merges and head movement invalidate cached loads.",
